(F5 T2 V4c: group_beam_direction_z (manual Professional 6.593) and
 element_beam_direction_z (6.415). Two 3D cantilevers of length 1 along
 x (tip velx fixed: the beam has no axial stiffness), E 1, G 1,
 group_beam_inertia Iyy 1 Izz 4 J 1, tip force 0.01 in y.
 Element 1: group local z = global z, bending about local z with Izz.
 Element 2: element_beam_direction_z 0 1 0 overrides the group, local
 z = global y, local y = -global z, bending with Iyy. Expected, =
 Professional 02-08-2026: node_dof 2 vely 8.333333333e-4 rotz 1.25e-3;
 node_dof 4 vely 3.333333333e-3 rotz 5e-3; element_beam_force_moment
 1 = 0 -0.01 0 0 0 -0.01 0 0.01 0 0 0 0 and
 2 = 0 0 -0.01 0 0.01 0 0 0 0.01 0 0 0.
 group_beam_memory -total_linear (the Professional default beam memory;
 the GNU default -updated rotates the beam chord: BEAM-MEMORY-DEFAULT).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0 0
node 2 1 0 0
node 3 0 2 0
node 4 1 2 0
element 1 -beam 1 2
element 2 -beam 3 4
group_type 0 -beam
group_beam_young 0 1
group_beam_shear 0 1
group_beam_inertia 0 1 4 1
group_beam_memory 0 -total_linear
group_beam_direction_z 0 0 0 1
element_beam_direction_z 2 0 1 0
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 3 -ra -velx -vely -velz -rotx -roty -rotz
bounda_dof 2 -ra 2 4 -ra -velx
bounda_force 1 -ra 2 4 -ra -vely
bounda_time 1 0.01
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
